    },
    {
      "ja": "• 搭乗ハッチを開閉できるギミックを搭載。コックピットに付属のフィギュアを搭乗させることが可能。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a gimmick that allows you to open and close the boarding hatch. It is possible to board the included figure in the cockpit."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• アイカメラを左右に動かせるギミックにより、ポージングに合わせた自然な視線移動を表現。",
      "en": "• A gimmick that allows the eye camera to move left and right allows for natural eye movements that match the pose."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 内部構造は版元監修のもと、プラモデルならではの新解釈を追加。",
      "en": "• The internal structure has been supervised by the publisher, and a new interpretation unique to plastic models has been added."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディテールやギミックなど細部まで再現。",
